lot for testing and evaluation purposes.</p>","+    <h3>2. The pilot</h3>","+    <p>The Service is a pilot for testing and evaluation, for personal, noncommercial use.</p>","     <ul class=\"list\">","-      <li>The pilot is planned to run for approximately one week per participant. We may extend, shorten, pause or end the pilot period at our discretion, and we will make reasonable efforts to give you notice of material changes.</li>","-      <li>The Service is experimental and still under active development. Features may change, behave inconsistently, be interrupted or be removed at any time. Availability is not guaranteed.</li>","-      <li>The Service is provided for your personal, noncommercial use only.</li>","-      <li>Participation in the pilot does not create any obligation on our part to launch a commercial service, to keep any feature available, or to grant you access to any future version.</li>","-      <li>When the pilot ends, your access to the Service will end. What happens to your data is described in the Privacy Policy (section 6).</li>","+      <li>Estimated duration about one week per participant. We may extend, shorten, pause or end it, and will give advance notice of a material change where feasible.</li>","+      <li>The Service is experimental and in development; features may change or stop, and availability is not guaranteed.</li>","+      <li>Participation does not oblige us to launch a commercial service or keep any feature or version.</li>","+      <li>When the pilot ends, access ends; for your data see Privacy section 6.</li>","     </ul>"," ","-    <h3>3. The Service is free</h3>","-    <p>Participation in the pilot is completely free. There is no payment at any stage, no payment method is collected, and no charge will ever be made in connection with the pilot. If we ever launch a paid service in the future, it will be a separate offering under separate terms, and will require your explicit signup; nothing in this pilot converts into a paid subscription.</p>","+    <h3>3. Free</h3>","+    <p>Participation is free. No payment method is collected and no charge is made. Any future paid service would be a separate offering under separate terms requiring explicit signup; the pilot does not convert into a subscription.</p>"," ","-    <h3>4. Fair use and daily allowance</h3>","-    <p>The Service runs on our own computing resources. To keep the pilot available for everyone, each participant has a daily usage allowance, measured as a number of messages or tokens per day.</p>","-    <ul class=\"list\">","-      <li>If you reach your allowance on a given day, the Agent will pause and let you know.</li>","-      <li>The allowance renews automatically the next day. You do not need to do anything, and no data or context is lost while the Agent is paused.</li>","-      <li>We may adjust the size of the allowance from time to time, including during the pilot, in order to keep the Service stable.</li>","-      <li>You may stop using the Service at any time, for any reason.</li>","-    </ul>","+    <h3>4. Daily allowance</h3>","+    <p>The Service runs on our resources, so each participant has a daily allowance (messages or tokens). When you reach it the Agent pauses and notifies you, and it renews automatically the next day with no loss of context. We may adjust its size for stability. You may stop at any time.</p>"," ","-    <h3>5. Eligibility and minimum age</h3>","-    <p>You must be at least 18 years old to use the Service. By using the Service you confirm that you are 18 or older. The Service is not directed at minors, and we do not knowingly allow minors to participate in the pilot. Use of the Service also requires a Telegram account, which is subject to Telegram's own terms and age requirements.</p>","+    <h3>5. Age</h3>","+    <p>You must be 18 or older, and by using the Service you confirm this. It is not directed at minors. A Telegram account is also required, subject to Telegram's terms.</p>"," ","-   