cy are the entire agreement between you and us regarding the pilot, and replace any prior understanding on this subject.</li>","-      <li><b>Severability.</b> If any provision of these Terms is found invalid or unenforceable, it will be replaced by a valid provision that most closely reflects its intent, and the remaining provisions will remain in full force.</li>","-      <li><b>No waiver.</b> A failure to enforce any provision is not a waiver of it.</li>","-      <li><b>Assignment.</b> You may not assign your rights under these Terms. We may assign these Terms to an affiliate or to a successor of the activity, provided your rights are not reduced.</li>","-      <li><b>Language.</b> These Terms are published in Hebrew and in English and are intended to be identical in substance. In case of inconsistency, the Hebrew version prevails.</li>","-    </ul>","+    <h3>18. General</h3>","+    <p>These Terms and the Privacy Policy are the entire agreement between us and replace prior understandings. An unenforceable provision is replaced by the closest valid one, and the rest remains. A failure to enforce is not a waiver. You may not assign your rights; we may assign to an affiliate or successor without reducing your rights. If the Hebrew and English versions conflict, the Hebrew prevails.</p>"," ","     <h3>19. Contact</h3>","-    <p>Questions about these Terms: <a href=\"mailto:elia@bencnaan.net\">elia@bencnaan.net</a></p>","+    <p><a href=\"mailto:elia@bencnaan.net\">elia@bencnaan.net</a></p>"," ","     <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>","-    <p class=\"eff\">Effective date: July 27, 2026 · Data controller: NanoCo · Contact: <a href=\"mailto:elia@bencnaan.net\">elia@bencnaan.net</a></p>","+    <p class=\"eff\">Effective: July 27, 2026 · Data controller: NanoCo · <a href=\"mailto:elia@bencnaan.net\">elia@bencnaan.net</a></p>"," ","     <h3>1. Overview</h3>","-    <p>This policy describes what information we collect during the pilot, how we use it, who can access it, and the choices you have. The short version: our analytics are based on behavioral data such as task types and usage patterns; our team does not read your conversations; we use data to improve the Service and for research and AI development; we do not sell data and we do not use it for advertising; and you can delete your data and your chat at any time.</p>","+    <p>This policy describes what we collect during the pilot, how we use it, who accesses it, and your choices. In short: analysis relies on usage data; we do not read conversations as a routine practice; data is used to improve the Service and for AI research and development; we do not sell data or use it for advertising; and you can delete it at any time.</p>"," ","     <h3>2. What we collect</h3>","-    <p><b>Information you provide at registration:</b> name, phone number and email address, as submitted in the signup form.</p>","-    <p><b>Conversation content:</b> messages you send to the Agent and the responses it generates pass through our systems, because that is how the Service works. Content is processed automatically in order to respond to you and to operate the Service.</p>","-    <p><b>Behavioral and technical data:</b> the types of tasks you ask the Agent to perform, usage patterns (for example frequency, times of use, session length and message counts), feature usage, error and performance events, and basic technical identifiers needed to route your messages (such as your Telegram user identifier).</p>","-    <p><b>What we do not collect:</b> we do not collect payment information (the pilot is free), we do not use advertising trackers, and we do not purchase data about you from third parties.</p>","-    <p>Please avoid sharing especially sensitive information with the Agent (for example medical, financial or biometric details about yourself or others) unless it is genuinely needed for a task you are asking it to perform.</p>","-","-    <h3>3. How we use information</h3>","-    <p>We use the information described above for the following purposes only:</p>","     <ul class=\"list\">","-      <li><b>Operating the Service:</b> processing your messages so the Agent can respond and perform tasks, maintaining context, and providing support.</li>","-      <li><b>Optimization and improvement:</b> understanding which kinds of tasks people use the Agent for and where it fails, so we can improve it. This analysis relies on behavioral data and aggregated statistics, not on reading personal content.</li>","-      <li><b>Research and AI development:</b> studying usage of the pilot and developing our AI systems. These uses are noncommercial: we do not sell personal data, we do not share it for advertising, and we do not use it to target you with marketing.</li>","-      <li><b>Safety and security:</b> preventing abuse, enforcing the Terms, and protecting the Service and its users.</li>","-      <li><b>Communicating with you:</b> messages about the pilot itself, such as onboarding, changes and ending of the pilot.</li>","+      <li><b>Registration details:</b> name, phone and email as submitted.</li>","+      <li><b>Conversation content:</b> your messages and the Agent's replies pass through our systems and are processed automatically to respond and operate the Service.</li>","+      <li><b>Usage and technical data:</b> task types, usage patterns (frequency, times, session length), feature usage, errors and performance, and technical identifiers for routing (such as your Telegram ID).</li>","     </ul>","+    <p>We do not collect payment details, use advertising trackers, or buy data from third parties. Please avoid sharing especially sensitive information (medical, financial, biometric) unless needed for a task.</p>"," ","-    <h3>4. Who can see your information</h3>","-    <p>The Service is designed so that people are not routinely exposed to your personal content:</p>","+    <h3>3. How we use it</h3>","     <ul class=\"list\">","-      <li>We do not read your conversations as a routine practice. Analytics, research and product decisions rely on behavioral data and aggregated statistics, not on reading individual chats.</li>","-      <li>Your personal content is not published, sold or exposed to third parties outside the systems that operate the Service.</li>","-      <li>Access to raw content is technically restricted, and our team will access specific content only in limited cases: to debug or troubleshoot a technical problem with the Service, if you ask us to (for example a support request about a specific conversation), if we are required to by law, or if it is strictly necessary to investigate abuse or a security incident. Any such access is limited to what is necessary for that purpose.</li>","+      <li><b>Operating the Service:</b> processing messages, maintaining context, providing support.</li>","+      <li><b>Improvement:</b> understanding task types and failure points — from usage data and aggregate statistics, not from reading personal content.</li>","+      <li><b>AI research and development:</b> a noncommercial use; we do not sell data, share it for advertising, or target you with marketing.</li>","+      <li><b>Safety and security:</b> preventing abuse and enforcing the Terms.</li>","+      <li><b>Communication:</b> messages about the pilot itself.</li>","     </ul>"," ","+    <h3>4. Who accesses your information</h3>","+    <p>We do not read conversations as a routine practice; analysis and research rely on usage data and aggregate statistics. Your content is not published, sold or exposed to third parties outside the systems operating the Service. Access to raw content is technically restricted, and we access a specific chat only in limited cases: fixing a fault, a support request from you, a legal obligation, or investigating abuse or a security incident — and only to the extent needed.</p>","+","     <h3>5. Sharing and processors</h3>","-    <p>We do not sell personal information and we do not share it for advertising. Info